Essay question: *"Writers often show that people are changed by suffering, but not always for the better. Discuss with reference to three prescribed texts."*

Without naming any real work (write **[Text A]**, **[Text B]** and **[Text C]**), produce:

1. a **thesis statement** of one or two sentences that takes a clear position;
2. **three topic sentences** for the body paragraphs, organised by idea and not by text;
3. one sentence explaining how you would handle the words **"but not always for the better"**.
